# Coordinator Todos

> **Long-lived task list** for the coordinator session. Outlives any single Claude Code session — what is here survives `/clear`, context compaction, and session restarts. Read this at the start of every coordinator session.
>
> **Not for transient work**: in-session step tracking belongs in the Claude task tool. This file holds dispatched-but-not-finished, paused, or follow-up items.

