## Conventions

- **One item per line**, with date prefix where helpful
- **No nested indentation** beyond one level — if an item needs sub-tasks, give it its own task-md
- **Date format**: `YYYY-MM-DD`
- **Mark resolved with date and brief outcome**, not just `[x]`, so the resolved log is useful as a reference
- **No emoji status markers** — the section heading is enough
